From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:07:22 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Share libzstd with erofs-utils

The product builds EROFS images and APEX payloads with Zstandard, so the
mkfs.erofs, fsck.erofs and dump.erofs tools link libzstd. Grant
external/erofs-utils the visibility the other users of the library have.
---
 Android.bp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 793a0c9eb30d210278d762f6c44c1ad1bb503031..e19fb3ad216c57fcedc82ab6a73f2c125cb8ac0a 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -75,6 +75,7 @@ cc_library {
         "//external/bpftool:__subpackages__",
         "//external/dwarves:__subpackages__",
         "//external/elfutils:__subpackages__",
+        "//external/erofs-utils:__subpackages__",
         "//external/libbpf:__subpackages__",
         "//external/mesa3d:__subpackages__",
         "//external/rsync:__subpackages__",
